# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- excel function check_path for debugging paths
- openid authentication support

### Changed
- replaced sqlalchemy with sqlhelp for database operations
- tests now use sqlhelp for postgresql cluster management
- updated pandas compatibility to version 2.3

### Fixed
- authentication brokenness

## [0.9.0] - 2025-02-26

### Added
- api/exists: new method to check series existence
- api/strip: new method to strip series data
- support for client connection configuration

### Changed
- improved error handling with dedicated exception types
- migrate from saturn references to refinery
- updated dependencies and compatibility

### Fixed
- http custom api registration
- api compatibility with latest tshistory

## [0.8.0] - 2024-09-04

### Added
- required roles on http routes for security
- pyproject.toml configuration
- pandas 2 compatibility

### Changed
- stop mangling series names in tsio/update (educate users instead)
- add essential flags to _expanded_formula for evaluator
- allow erasures in insert-from-many (explicit nan handling)
- removed last references to saturn

### Fixed
- operators deprecation warnings
- general deprecation warnings

### Removed
- today operator renamed to now (following tshistory_formula)

## [0.7.1] - 2023-09-25

### Fixed
- pytype compatibility issues
- typing annotations corrections

## [0.7.0] - 2023-08-11

### Added
- schema registration at init-db time
- __version__ attribute in package root

### Changed
- adapted to tshistory internal/user metadata split
- improved test isolation
- better error messages

### Fixed
- api compatibility with tshistory 0.19
- test database setup

## [0.6.0] - 2023-02-24

### Added
- support for tree api operations
- formula groups support
- metadata handling improvements

### Changed
- adapted to tshistory schema changes
- improved test coverage

### Fixed
- http api compatibility issues

## [0.5.1] - 2023-01-02

### Fixed
- packaging issues with missing files

## [0.5.0] - 2022-12-26

### Added
- group support in excel interface
- basic operations on groups

### Changed
- improved error handling
- better integration with tshistory_refinery

## [0.4.1] - 2022-10-11

### Fixed
- catalog compatibility with tshistory 0.15

## [0.4.0] - 2022-06-23

### Added
- insertion_dates api support
- metadata operations from excel

### Changed
- adapted to tshistory 0.14 api changes
- improved excel macros

### Fixed
- date handling in excel interface

## [0.3.0] - 2022-01-13

### Added
- formula support in excel
- basic formula operations

### Changed
- migrated to pyproject.toml
- adapted to tshistory_rest being folded into tshistory

### Fixed
- http client initialization

## [0.2.1] - 2021-09-21

### Fixed
- werkzeug compatibility (pinned to version < 2)

## [0.2.0] - 2020-12-11

### Added
- comprehensive documentation
- xlwings addin instructions
- basic web blueprint

### Changed
- improved readme with installation instructions
- better error messages

### Fixed
- packaging to include xlam file

### Removed
- unneeded engine pool in blueprint

## [0.1.1] - 2020-09-04

### Fixed
- packaging issues:
  - missing dependencies
  - included xlam file in distribution
  - pypi long description

### Added
- trove classifiers

## [0.1.0] - 2020-09-04

### Added
- initial excel client for tshistory
- basic operations: get, update, delete series
- excel macros for time series operations
- http api integration
- basic test suite